    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87223" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεκ-τρέχω</span></b> , aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έδραμον,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>run out before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.166
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cor.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pel.</u>
				23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shoot out before the season,</i>
